## UI design & theme

### Brand identity

Warm, calm healthcare feel — **soft cream backgrounds**, **rose/red primary**, **GeneralSans** typography.

### Colors (`AppColors` — always use, do not invent)

| Token | Hex / usage |
|-------|-------------|
| `primary` | `#E81848` — CTA buttons, focus borders, accents |
| `primaryLite` | `#FEF9FA` — success/onboarding screens bg |
| `primaryLiteChip` | `#FFCFD5` — chips, highlights |
| `background` | `#FFFDF9` — scaffold default (theme) |
| `surface` | `#FBFBFB` — text field fill |
| `textPrimary` | `#1F1F1F` — headings, body |
| `textSecondary` | `#717171` — subtitles, labels |
| `textHint` | `#7A7A7A` — placeholders |
| `divider` | `#D9DDDF` — card borders |
| `error` | red — validation, flushbar errors |
| `darkButton` | `#221F1F` — secondary dark CTAs |

Card surfaces often use `#F9FBFC` with light shadow — prefer `AppColors.surface` / `divider` when adding new cards.

### Typography (`AppTextStyles` + `.sp`)

| Style | Size | Weight | Use |
|-------|------|--------|-----|
| `h1` | 24.sp | bold | Screen titles |
| `h2` | 20.sp | w700 | Section headers |
| `h3` | 18.sp | w600 | Subsections |
| `bodyLarge` | 16.sp | w500 | Primary body |
| `bodyMedium` | 14.sp | w500 | Default text, inputs |
| `bodySmall` | 12.sp | normal | Meta, dates |
| `label` | 12.sp | w400 | Field labels |
| `button` | 16.sp | w500 | Button text (white on primary) |
| `caption` | 12.sp | normal | Hints, footnotes |

- Font family: **`GeneralSans`** only (`AppTextStyles.fontFamily`).
- Do **not** use `google_fonts` for new screens unless explicitly required.

### Spacing & layout

- Screen horizontal padding: **`20.w`** (standard from home/healer screens).
- Section gaps: **`8.h`–`16.h`** between label and field; **`20.h`–`24.h`** between sections.
- Card padding: **`12.w`**; card radius: **`16.r`**.
- Input/button radius: **`12.r`**.
- Avatar/circle images: **`30.r`** or `50.w` square with `ClipRRect`.
- All sizes via ScreenUtil: `.w`, `.h`, `.sp`, `.r` — no raw pixel literals for layout.

### Shared widgets (use first)

| Widget | When |
|--------|------|
| `CommonButton` | Primary CTA — height `52.h`, radius `12.r`, bg `AppColors.primary` |
| `CommonTextField` | All form inputs — filled `AppColors.surface`, focus border `primary` |
| `CommonImage` | Local assets + network paths |
| `CommonFlushbar` | success / error / warning toasts (top position default) |
| `CommonSuccessScreen` | Route `/success` with `extra` map for image, title, CTA |
| `SwipeableButton` | Swipe-to-confirm actions |

### Screen structure

```dart
Scaffold(
  backgroundColor: AppColors.background, // or Colors.white for list-heavy screens
  body: SafeArea(
    child: BlocBuilder<XBloc, XState>(
      builder: (context, state) {
        if (state is XLoading) return /* AutoSkeleton or CircularProgressIndicator */;
        if (state is XError) return /* error UI + retry */;
        // loaded content
      },
    ),
  ),
)
```

### Loading states

- Global skeleton colors in `main.dart`: base `#E0E0E0`, highlight `#F5F5F5`.
- Wrap loading list/detail content in **`AutoSkeleton`** (see `healer_list_screen`, `home_screen`).
- Full-screen first load: `Center(child: CircularProgressIndicator())` only if skeleton not used.

### Cards & chips

- Cards: light bg, `BorderRadius.circular(16.r)`, subtle `BoxShadow` opacity `0.02`, border `AppColors.divider`.
- Availability / tags: `AvailabilityChip` pattern — available = pink tint `#FFF2F5` + `primary` border.

### Feedback & navigation

- Errors: `CommonFlushbar.error(context, state.message)`.
- Success: `CommonFlushbar.success` or navigate to `/success` with `extra`.
- Navigation: `context.push`, `context.go`, path params (`/healer-detail/:healerId`).

